  "description": "YUXQAL crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C92 H102 Gd4 N6 O34,6(C1 H4 O1). From the CIF bond table, Gd1 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd2 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd3 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd4 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.426-3.760 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 85.63-103.74°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Gd4(HL)2(H3L)2(H2L')2(PhCOO)2]·6CH3OH.",
